    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad47f0a24dc073b88e29a4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征因为疲劳而受伤导致取消国外远征。\n天狼星象征气愤地认为\n这是她的傲慢和软弱所导致的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ec8a63e8d2be9981705fe36f8ba91be192be9d86d9de732c5645261a9e214e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
