    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c28e28436ede10f2865e8d59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然天狼星象征以代理身份\n获得了国外挑战的权利，\n但她的举止却变得比以往更奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe2d61ac4882b2d9b2b0b52fa005de8b46f40aacdac18cfe6deb5b03bcd37ff4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
