      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看起来对鲁道夫象征的\n执着开始吞噬她，\n甚至侵蚀起她原本的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f78f8ba3146e342fcee844962294da5d6f06742e3ea9cd2fff1005ab55d8b4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
