    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0365f90fb17b5411f5e68cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在与训练员进行过台球比赛后，\n天狼星象征领悟到自己的状况不佳，\n于是决定国外远征就此延期。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86ed3aab5ade6c7330fa2bb77b4dac1affd9c778f2b3d8dacc0e7cdd8a1a82c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070404.json",
      "json_path": [
