    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a605e9cbcae86f2899e65679",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“想跟鲁道夫象征变回原来的关系”\n天狼星象征持续逃避面对自己的真实想法，\n导致内心不断地受到侵蚀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a2c6abfb65e7d901e9d78ab49273926fe6db872bd175d6bf4c049ea2b1c33a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
