    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a867c301669ba67e75d39b95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，我们与鲁道夫象征\n还有URA职员们正式开始讨论起\n“国外远征计划”的相关事宜，不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "66de8ac6d90a4868647e8ee0ae982102620b6095766cefe190eaaf238ac783fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
