    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:427af85990f3770d030019f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因派天狼星象征挑战国外一事上分成了\n反对派和赞成派，会议逐渐混乱失序。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b2890c3e63d1c54d43a66edefb4ff7c7ec03590f351a3fe4d0f7e7a9c98a41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d47c20a7e88b982f4296eaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db34e20c6fb69da8e5c42519",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征高声宣告道，既然如此\n就在一年内拿出成绩，并持续赢下比赛，\n利用这点来筹措资金。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83f2054a1b521e767630fab73de72995c7283ce1337f8879bb5ee2fd2a2c6054",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca975e993c34b24597799e19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“让他们明白就好”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08101db55b037778e7c1be38e7f1ba402aad605c6187099085cbbc8b358effd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070405.json",
      "json_path": [
