    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a7603c4963eb305bc61f39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要走在她开拓的道路上是无所谓，\n但她不会引导任何人──\n这样的天狼星象征也逐渐改变了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "401a54b8f9c8c62f65bb2ec90d67c3881b5f1652bbe163e460c2487a5ecc4fe6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
